            "notes": "# ITEMS\n\nWith our currently lackluster [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), we can grab [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) to improve it, as well as further increasing our [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) from healing with Harmony Orb.\n\nIf you have the extra cash or simply finding yourself taking too much damage, [Transference Protocol](item_04d5d433-9493-4094-b4e6-77d632a236e9) can help you take advantage of your high [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) by healing you when you charge your volleys. You can also substitute [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) to permanently get the same [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) boost, trading [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) for [Move Speed](stat_move_speed).\n\n*PROTIP: You can charge up your next volley faster by using melee to cancel it versus firing it. This can also help avoid making too much sound if you are flanking.*",
