            "notes": "# ITEMS\n\nFor the next two rounds, the following items can be put in your remaining 2 slots to also give at least a 10% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) boost:\n\n- [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204)\n- [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)\n- [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) \n- [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61)\n- [Volskaya Ordnance](item_396c0970-daa8-47e3-8049-e65f03fe5cec)  \n\n[Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) and [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) are also options, but you may want to wait until Round 7 before grabbing this, as the [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) boost isn't as helpful for you yet.\n\nThe following items are more situational but can still give 10% or more [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed):\n- [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) (*requires good Harmony Orb uptime*)\n- [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) (*gives 15% but not recommended unless the enemy literally only has shields*)\n- [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) (*only if your ult isn't very useful against the enemy comp*)",
