            "notes": "# POWERS\n\n[Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) is by far the best pick here. With our super high [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), we can land far more critical hits, and this gives us a significant boost to our discorded crits. [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) can help with getting out of a tricky situation (*NOTE: This counts as an ability towards the [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) speed buff and the [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) damage buff, but NOT towards the [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) ammo restoration buff*). [Seeking Salvation](item_c424d9c0-3a6e-4eb6-b845-cfa284481307) is not recommended but can help you finish off weaker targets.\n\n# ITEMS\n\nAssuming you picked [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) as your power, [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) and  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) are more viable options now to increase attack speed and deal even more damage on discorded crits. \n\nIf you find your attack speed to be good enough at 55%, [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) is a great choice to boost your lackluster [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
